00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:06,700
Listen, can you do me a favor? I'm gonna be out today.
聽著，你可以幫我一個忙嗎？ 我今天要出去

159
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:08,230
Can you keep an eye on Joey..
你可以幫我看著喬伊

160
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:11,000
make sure nothing happens between him and Molly?
確保他跟莫莉之間不會出事嗎？

161
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:13,330
- You don't trust him? - Well, no.
-你不相信他嗎？ -嗯，不相信

162
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:16,240
Some woman who sounded a lot like Joey called earlier..
昨晚有個聽起來 很像喬伊的女人打電話來

163
00:10:16,410 --> 00:10:20,310
and asked for her daughter, the "hot nanny."
要找她那個叫做「辣保姆」的女兒

164
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:23,740
Is this your long-term plan, for me to run interference?
你打算讓我長期干預他們嗎？

165
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:27,580
Because I could get a job any day now.
我可能隨時都會找到工作的

166
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:31,350
You do appear right on the cusp of something.
你在職場上可真是炙手可熱

167
00:10:31,530 --> 00:10:34,820
Look, come on, man. I'm sure he'll lose interest in a week or two..
聽著，拜託 我確定他一兩星期就會沒興趣了

168
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,460
but for now, could you please just do this for me?
但是現在，你可以幫我這個忙嗎？

169
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:39,560
Fine, but don't blame me if it doesn't work.
好啦，但是如果失敗可別怪我喔

170
00:10:39,730 --> 00:10:42,330
Because you know once Joey sets his mind on something..
因為你也瞭解，喬伊一旦下定決心

171
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:45,960
more often than not, he's going to have sex with it.
無論如何，他都會把她搞上手的

172
00:10:47,410 --> 00:10:50,100
Well, I mean, we've gotta do something. Okay?
那我們得要做點什麼，不是嗎？

173
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:54,110
Nannies like her don't grow on trees.
像她那樣的保姆是不會 憑空出現在樹上的

174
00:10:56,450 --> 00:10:58,650
- Picturing that tree? - I am, yes.
-在想像那棵樹嗎？ -是的，沒錯

175
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:08,490
Where you going, Joe?
你要去哪？喬伊

176
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:14,630
For a walk.
去散步

177
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,770
You mind if I join you?
我也去好嗎？

178
00:11:17,140 --> 00:11:22,300
Actually, I'd rather be alone. You know, I really need to organize my thoughts.
事實上，我想要一個人去 我真的需要理清一些想法

179
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:25,810
Your thoughts?
一些想法？

180
00:11:26,110 --> 00:11:27,810
Plural?
複數的？

181
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:32,510
