好啦，我只有一個想法

182
00:11:33,250 --> 00:11:35,350
It's about the hot nanny! I gotta see her!
就是關於那個辣保姆！我必須見到她！

183
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:39,880
- I'm afraid I can't let you do that, Joe. - Now you're saying I can't see her?
-恐怕我不能讓你去，喬伊 -你是說我不能見她？

184
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:44,560
You're killing me! She's forbidden fruit! It's like, like..
你是在害死我！她是禁果！這就像…

185
00:11:44,770 --> 00:11:48,530
like she's the princess and I'm the stable boy.
她是公主而我是馬童

186
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:52,500
Look, I know. She's the most beautiful woman in the world.
聽著，我知道她是世上最漂亮的女人

187
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:54,300
I can hear you.
我聽見了

188
00:11:54,610 --> 00:11:58,770
Could you set my pillow and blanket on the couch for me, please?
你可以幫我把枕頭跟毛毯 鋪到沙發上嗎？

189
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:02,680
Why are you doing this, huh?
為什麼你要這樣？

190
00:12:02,850 --> 00:12:05,220
Did Ross tell you not to let me go over there?
是不是羅斯要你別讓我過去的呢？

191
00:12:05,450 --> 00:12:08,150
Yes, as a matter of fact, he did. So I can't let you go.
沒錯，事實上就是 所以我不能讓你過去

192
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:12,190
Interesting. Now there are obstacles.
有趣，現在出現阻礙了

193
00:12:13,830 --> 00:12:16,850
Hot nanny and me against the world!
辣保姆跟我一起抵抗全世界！

194
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:19,160
This is the stuff great novels are made of.
這就像偉大的愛情小說

195
00:12:19,370 --> 00:12:21,960
- Great novels? - Fine. Mediocre porn.
-偉大的愛情小說？ -好啦，二流的情色書刊

196
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,930
- Gavin Mitchell's office. - Rachel Greene's office.
-蓋文米丘辦公室 -瑞秋葛林辦公室

197
00:12:29,110 --> 00:12:30,670
Give me that phone.
電話給我

198
00:12:32,110 --> 00:12:35,840
Hello, this is Rachel Greene. How can I help you?
哈囉，我是瑞秋葛林 可以為您效勞嗎？

199
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:40,880
Okay then. I'll pass you back to your son.
好的，我會把電話傳給你兒子

200
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:44,890
Hey, Mom. No, that's just my secretary.
媽，不是，她只是我的秘書

201
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,960
Excuse me, Gavin. I have a question I need to ask you.
對不起，蓋文 我有個問題必須要問你

202
00:12:51,130 --> 00:12:54,190
Mom, I'll call you later. Yeah.
媽，我再回電給你，是的

203
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:57,870
- Yes? - If you like looking at butts so much..
-怎樣？ -如果你那麼喜歡看屁股…

204
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:01,500
why don't you just go look in a mirror?
你何不自己去照鏡子呢？

205
00:13:02,380 --> 00:13:03,780
Thank God you finally said that.
感謝上帝，你終於說了

206
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:07,240
I saw you make a note on your pad three hours ago.
三個小時前我就看到 你寫在筆記本上了

207
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:12,650
- Man, I really bug you. Don't I? - Oh, no. Please..
-天啊，我真的惹你厭，是不是？ -喔，不，拜託…

208
00:13:12,820 --> 00:13:14,650
