我非常能幹的同事，而且更重要的是…

216
00:13:35,980 --> 00:13:38,810
my wonderful friend, Gavin Mitchell.
我的好朋友，蓋文米丘

217
00:13:39,050 --> 00:13:40,810
- Pleased to meet you. - Pleased to meet you.
-幸會 -幸會

218
00:13:40,980 --> 00:13:42,540
Are you coming to Rachel's party?
你會來參加瑞秋的派對嗎？

219
00:13:42,750 --> 00:13:46,120
Oh, no, no, no, no. Gavin can't. He already has plans..
喔，不不不不，蓋文沒有辦法 他已經有計劃了

220
00:13:46,290 --> 00:13:48,760
most likely with his mother.
應該是要去看他媽媽

221
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:53,660
I don't mind. I'll cancel them. I would never miss my secretary's birthday.
我不介意，我可以取消 我不想錯過我秘書的生日

222
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:59,930
Why did you invite him? I can't stand that guy!
為什麼你要邀請他？ 我無法忍受那個男的！

223
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:02,600
- You were being so nice to him. - I was faking it.
-你看起來跟他很好啊 -我是裝出來的

224
00:14:02,770 --> 00:14:04,600
Can't you tell when I'm being fake?
你難道看不出來我是裝的嗎？

225
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:08,210
Hey, Mr. Phillips. Nice suit.
嘿，菲利浦先生，很好看的西裝

226
00:14:08,380 --> 00:14:11,340
Right there. That was so fake!
抓到了，真是好假！

227
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,950
Hey, Chandler, which do you like better..
嘿，錢德，你比較喜歡…

228
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:25,420
the tuna tartare or the mushroom empanadas?
鮪魚派還是烤蘑菇餃？

229
00:14:27,330 --> 00:14:31,770
- The pile of raw fish, or the tacos? - Oh, the tacos. Definitely, the tacos.
-一堆生魚還是墨西哥手卷？ -喔，手卷，當然是手卷

230
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:37,530
I still can't believe you invited Gavin.
我真不敢相信，你邀請了蓋文

231
00:14:37,740 --> 00:14:40,570
He is just the last person I want to see.
他是我最不想見到的人

232
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:44,300
You're welcome for the party. I'm glad you're having a good time.
安排派對的事，不用跟我客氣 我很高興你喜歡

233
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:48,170
I hope he doesn't show up. Of course he won't, the guy hates me.
我希望他不要出現 他當然不會，他討厭我

234
00:14:48,350 --> 00:14:50,370
- Does he? - What?
-是嗎？ -什麼？

235
00:14:50,850 --> 00:14:53,880
Maybe he keeps bothering you so much because he likes you.
或許他一直惹你生氣 是因為喜歡你

236
