It's like in first grade when Skippy Lange would push me..
就像在小學一年級的時候 史基藍吉會推我…

237
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:59,390
because he secretly had a crush on me.
其實是因為他在暗戀我

238
00:14:59,590 --> 00:15:02,790
Monica, you think Skippy liked you?
摩妮卡，你以為史基喜歡你嗎？

239
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:06,260
Honey, all those boys had a bet to see if he could knock you over.
親愛的，所有的男生都在打賭 看他是不是有辦法撂倒你

240
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:11,400
- She's out. I'm gonna take her home. - Okay. Thank you.
-她睡了，我帶她回去 -好的，謝謝

241
00:15:11,570 --> 00:15:14,040
Bye, sweetheart.
再見，甜心

242
00:15:16,780 --> 00:15:19,300
Do you see what all the guys see in her?
你有在她身上看到 那些男人看到的東西嗎？

243
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:22,040
Wouldn't kick her out of bed.
不會想要踢她下床的

244
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:24,020
No more vodka for me.
我不可以再喝伏特加了

245
00:15:25,890 --> 00:15:28,320
Hey, Rach. So can I sing "Happy Birthday" to you now?
嘿，瑞秋，現在可以 唱生日快樂歌了嗎？

246
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:32,010
- Yeah, sure. - All right.
-當然可以 -好的

247
00:15:33,730 --> 00:15:35,790
See you later.
待會見

248
00:15:36,730 --> 00:15:38,560
Hey, Rach. Somebody got you shoes.
瑞秋，有人送你鞋子

249
00:15:38,730 --> 00:15:39,930
Give me!
給我看！

250
00:15:41,070 --> 00:15:46,530
- Wow. Wow. Oh, my God! - Careful! Careful!
-哇哇，我的天啊！ -小心！小心！

251
00:15:46,740 --> 00:15:49,070
These are my rat babies!
這些是我的老鼠寶寶！

252
00:15:51,810 --> 00:15:55,250
Yeah. We have rat babies now.
是啊，我們現在有老鼠寶寶了

253
00:15:56,780 --> 00:16:00,450
You brought rats to my birthday party?
你帶老鼠來參加我的生日派對？

254
00:16:00,650 --> 00:16:03,590
So this is what a stroke feels like.
我感覺像是中風一樣

255
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:06,120
Well, I had to bring them. We killed their mother.
我必須要帶著他們 我們殺了他們的媽

256
00:16:06,290 --> 00:16:08,520
They're our responsibility now.
他們現在是我們的責任了

257
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:12,660
You know, they require constant care. You should know that, you're a mother.
你知道的，他們需要一直被照顧 你應該知道的，你自己也是母親

258
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:17,370
Are you comparing my daughter to a rat?
你把我女兒跟一隻老鼠做比較？

259
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:19,570
No. Seven rats.
不，是七隻

260
00:16:21,140 --> 00:16:23,440
We should take them home. We need to feed them.
我們應該帶他們回家了 他們需要吃東西了

261
00:16:23,610 --> 00:16:26,370
You're gonna leave my party to take care of a box of rats?
你因為要照顧這盒老鼠 而離開我的派對？

262
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:28,980
Well, I'm sorry, Rachel, but I'm not like you. Okay?
嗯，我很抱歉，瑞秋 但是我不像你，好嗎？

263
00:16:29,150 --> 00:16:31,810
Not everyone can afford help.
不是每個人都請得起幫手的

264
00:16:39,230 --> 00:16:41,160
Hey, where the hell are Joey and Molly?
嘿，喬伊跟莫莉去哪了？

265
00:16:41,330 --> 00:16:42,820
I asked you to watch them.
我要你看住他們的

266
00:16:43,030 --> 00:16:45,520
I'm sorry. I got a little preoccupied.
我很抱歉，我有點分心了

267
00:16:46,670 --> 00:16:49,690
Look, we have to stop them before something happens.
聽著，我們要在發生事情前阻止他們

268
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,700
Right behind you, big guy.
我會跟隨你的，大哥

269
00:16:54,510 --> 00:16:56,810
So you see, Molly, what people don't understand..
所以你瞧，莫莉 人們不瞭解…

270
00:16:57,010 --> 00:17:00,670
is that acting is a discipline. It takes a lot of hard work.
演戲是一種紀律，是很辛苦的工作

271
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:03,750
- So where'd you study? - I didn't go to college.
-所以你是在哪裡學的？ -我沒有上大學

272
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:09,850
- No, where'd you study acting? - Molly, people don't study acting.
-那，是從哪裡學會演戲的呢？ -莫莉，演戲不是學來的

273
00:17:12,730 --> 00:17:16,530
Molly, do you mind giving us just a minute?
莫莉，可以讓我們談幾分鐘嗎？

274
00:17:16,730 --> 00:17:18,990
- Sure. I'll go check on Emma. - Thanks.
-當然，我去看艾□ -謝謝

275
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:23,990
Will the stable boy never get the princess?
馬童就不能得到公主嗎？

276
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:28,500
What do you think you were gonna do, have sex with her here on my couch?
你以為你是在做什麼？ 在我家沙發上跟她作愛？

277
00:17:28,710 --> 00:17:31,910
No. The leather sticks to my ass.
不，沙發皮會黏住我的屁股

278
00:17:33,250 --> 00:17:36,510
This isn't fair. What makes you think I'm gonna sleep with her..
這實在不公平，你憑什麼認為 我會跟她上床…

279
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,050
and then blow her off, huh?
然後就拋棄她呢？

280
00:17:38,220 --> 00:17:42,660
Can't you guys open your minds to the possibility that I actually like her..
你們難道不能敞開心胸接受 或許我是真的喜歡她…

281
00:17:42,820 --> 00:17:44,650
and might want something real?
而且要的是真感情？

282
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:51,360
Look, the truth is, I haven't felt this way about anyone since Rachel.
聽著，事情是，自從瑞秋之後 我就沒有對任何人有過這種感覺了

283
00:17:51,530 --> 00:17:54,730
Okay? I didn't think I could ever love again.
好嗎？我以為我不能再愛人了

284
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:57,190
- Come on! - Joe!
-少來了！ -喬伊！

285
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:05,880
Hi. Is Molly here?
嗨，莫莉在嗎？

286
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,780
Yeah, yeah. Come on in. Molly?
在，請進，莫莉？

287
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:13,620
- Hey. Guys, this is Tabitha. - Hey.
-嘿，各位，這位是塔比莎 -嘿

288
00:18:15,060 --> 00:18:18,580
- I'll see you tomorrow. - Okay.
-明天見 -好的

289
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:32,100
Well, Joey, I guess we have no problem.
嗯，喬伊，我猜我們沒事了

290
00:18:33,210 --> 00:18:37,080
It's like my favorite fairy tale come true.
這就像是美夢成真

291
00:18:38,410 --> 00:18:41,780
The princess, the stable boy and the lesbian.
公主、馬童跟女同性戀

292
00:18:45,250 --> 00:18:47,520
Okay. Okay, you start preparing the formula..
好了，你先泡牛奶

293
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,420
and I'll start changing the box.
我去換盒子

294
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:52,720
And then we gotta put them straight to bed.
然後就送他們上床睡覺

295
00:18:52,930 --> 00:18:54,790
When did we become one of those couples..
為什麼要讓我們的愛情生活…

296
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:57,450
whose lives revolve around their rats?
環繞著老鼠呢？

297
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:01,800
Well, you know what? They're our responsibility now.
你知道嗎？他們現在是我們的責任了

298
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:05,490
Okay, fine. These rats are our responsibility.
好的，這些老鼠是我們的責任

299
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:08,110
What happens when they mate and there are hundreds?
要是他們交配後 變成上百隻呢？

300
00:19:08,310 --> 00:19:11,280
Mate? They're all brothers and sisters.
交配？他們是兄弟姐妹耶

301
00:19:11,610 --> 00:19:14,050
Yeah, not such a problem with rats.
是啊，但是對老鼠可不是問題

302
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:17,650
No, they're more of a "love the one you're with" kind of animal.
他們是「愛上誰就上誰」的那種

303
00:19:18,450 --> 00:19:20,510
No. Really?
才不，真的嗎？

304
00:19:20,690 --> 00:19:24,150
Oh, my.. Get off your sister!
喔…不要搞你姐姐啦！

305
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:28,350
Oh, my God. What are we gonna do?
我的天，我們該怎麼辦呢？

306
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:31,660
The.. We have seven rats.
我們有七隻老鼠

307
00:19:31,830 --> 00:19:34,460
So, what if each of them has seven rats..
如果七隻老鼠的每一隻…

308
00:19:34,640 --> 00:19:38,570
and then each of those has seven rats? That's like..
都再生七隻，那就是…

309
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,800
That's math I can't even do!
我不會算數學！

310
00:19:45,810 --> 00:19:47,780
What are we gonna do?
我們該怎麼辦呢？

311
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:50,380
Well, I know this is gonna sound crazy..
嗯，我知道這聽起來很瘋狂…

312
00:19:50,550 --> 00:19:57,150
but we could not let the box of rats ruin our lives.
但我們可以不讓這盒老鼠 毀了我們的生活

313
00:19:59,190 --> 00:20:02,750
Yeah, okay. I guess you're right.
是啊，好吧，我想你說的對

314
00:20:02,930 --> 00:20:06,300
All right, so we should just give them away.
好了，我們必須要送走他們

315
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:12,400
But to nice families with children and reduced-fat Wheat Thins.
但要送給有小孩 還有低脂餅乾的好人家

316
00:20:12,570 --> 00:20:14,940
Those were Bob's favorites.
那些是霸柏最喜歡的

317
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:17,040
It's gonna be okay.
會沒事的

318
00:20:18,350 --> 00:20:22,110
- You must think I'm crazy. - No, I think you're sweet.
-你一定認為我瘋了 -不，我覺得你很善良

319
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:28,740
Good. This is just so hard. It's hard for me to let them go.
這真是很難，好難割捨

320
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:32,880
I guess it just brings back memories, you know..
我猜這讓我聯想起很多往事

321
00:20:33,430 --> 00:20:38,330
from when I gave birth to my brother's triplets and I had to give them up.
就像我懷了我弟的三胞胎 最後還是必須送回給他們養

322
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:46,740
I haven't told you about that yet, have I?
我沒有告訴過你那件事嗎？

323
00:20:59,290 --> 00:21:02,550
Thanks for the party, honey. Should I help you clean up?
謝謝你幫我辦派對，親愛的 我應該幫你打掃嗎？

324
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:07,060
No way. You had your party. Now I have mine.
不要，你的派對結束了 現在換我的

325
00:21:10,130 --> 00:21:12,290
- Is everything all right? - I just get bummed..
-一切還好吧 -我只是有點累

326
00:21:12,470 --> 00:21:13,960
when my birthday's over.
生日結束了

327
00:21:14,130 --> 00:21:17,370
Well, at least you have one thing to be happy about.
至少有一件事值得你高興

328
00:21:17,540 --> 00:21:20,560
That jerk, Gavin, from your office didn't show up.
你辦公室那個渾蛋蓋文沒有來

329
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:23,440
Yeah, I hate him.
是啊，他好討厭哦

330
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:28,740
We weren't talking about you. We were..
我們不是在說你，我們…

331
00:21:28,950 --> 00:21:32,820
No. No way to recover. No. Okay.
好吧，來不及轉了，算了

332
00:21:34,490 --> 00:21:37,920
- Fun party. - Well, it was.
-一定很好玩 -嗯，是的

333
00:21:38,090 --> 00:21:40,890
And you would have seen it if you didn't show up at..
你本來會看到的，如果你出現在…

334
00:21:41,060 --> 00:21:46,560
9:30?! God! This party was lame.
九點半？天啊！這派對糟透了

335
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:49,660
Again, you're welcome!
再一次，不用客氣！

336
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:54,540
- Look, I'll just give you this and go. - You bought me a present. Why?
-聽著，我只是要給你這個就走人 -你買禮物給我，為什麼？

337
00:21:55,710 --> 00:21:59,410
Let me explain how birthday parties usually work. There are presents..
讓我解釋一下生日派對 是怎樣的情況，通常有禮物…

338
00:21:59,580 --> 00:22:02,410
and a cake, perhaps a fourth or fifth person.
有蛋糕，或許還有第四個或第五個人

339
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:06,720
Okay, I..
好的，我…

340
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:10,860
I got you the present to make up for being such a jerk to you.
我送禮物給你 彌補一下我對你的惡劣

341
00:22:11,530 --> 00:22:16,020
Well, okay. Well, that's very nice. And you wrote a card.
嗯，好的，真好，而且你還寫了卡片

342
00:22:16,930 --> 00:22:19,400
- "From Gavin." - I really mean it.
-「蓋文贈」 -肺腑之言

343
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:28,200
It's beautiful.
很美耶

344
00:22:28,410 --> 00:22:30,600
If you don't mind..? Let me.
如果你不介意… 讓我來

345
00:22:32,910 --> 00:22:36,140
Well, what do you know, it fits.
誰知道呢，非常合適

346
00:22:38,150 --> 00:22:42,590
See, Gavin. You're capable of being a nice guy.
瞧，蓋文，你是可以當個好男人的

347
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:44,820
Why do you give me such a hard time?
為什麼你要刁難我呢？

348
00:22:46,090 --> 00:22:47,620
I'm not sure.
我不知道

349
00:22:47,930 --> 00:22:52,830
Well, Monica seems to think it's because you have feelings for me.
摩妮卡好像認為 是因為你對我有感覺

350
00:22:53,070 --> 00:22:55,130
I do have feelings for you.
我是對你有感覺

351
00:22:57,040 --> 00:23:00,170
- You do? - Yes. I feel that you're a little annoying.
-真的嗎？ -是的，我覺得你很煩人

352
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,970
See, why? Gavin, why?
為什麼？蓋文，為什麼？

353
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:07,270
Right when I'm about to change my opinion of you, you go and you..
就在我要對你改觀的時候，你就…

354
00:23:10,620 --> 00:23:13,350
And you do that.
你就這樣做了

355
00:23:39,180 --> 00:23:42,480
Hey. Listen, I think I left something here.
嘿，聽著，我有東西忘了帶走

356
00:23:43,580 --> 00:23:46,550
Well, somebody left this. Is this yours?
是有人忘了這個，是你的嗎？

357
00:23:46,750 --> 00:23:48,220
No, but I like it.
不是，但是我蠻喜歡的

358
00:23:49,420 --> 00:23:52,390
No, I think I left one of my rat babies.
有一隻老鼠寶寶我忘了帶走

359
00:23:54,130 --> 00:23:57,030
Well, no. I haven't seen it, but if I do, I'll let you know.
沒，我沒有看到 但是如果有，我會讓你知道

360
00:23:57,200 --> 00:24:00,500
Rat baby! Rat baby! Rat baby! Rat baby!
老鼠寶寶！老鼠寶寶！老鼠寶寶！

361
00:24:02,070 --> 00:24:03,090
Maybe that's him.
或許就是他

362
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


363
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
